Team,

The multi-component Kistler dynamometer table setup has been calibrated ahead of the 25-condition milling experimental sequence.

Verification Summary:
- X_Load_Cell, Y_Load_Cell, and Z_Load_Cell piezoelectric transducers were static-loaded up to 5 kN; linearity R² > 0.9998 across all axes.
- Zero-offset drift on raw voltage channels is within ±0.005 V after 1-hour warm-up.
- Charge amplifier sensitivity settings: X = -7.82 pC/N, Y = -7.84 pC/N, Z = -3.71 pC/N.
- Synchronized DAQ sampling rate confirmed at exactly 10,000 Hz across all 6 analog channels (Vib_Spindle, Vib_Table, X_Load_Cell, Y_Load_Cell, Z_Load_Cell, Current).

All sensor channels are clear for canonical data acquisition.

Alex Rivera
